       title: "layout"
     package: "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/oasis-tcs/cacao/master/Extensions/layout/schemas/layout/"
 description: "Canvas & Coordinates are two components encapsulated in one object. The canvas component is meant to be used in the playbook metadata level (section 3.1 in the CACAO specification [CACAO-Security-Playbooks-v2.0]), whereas the Coordinates component is meant to be used with Workflow Steps and Agent and Targets."
       roots: ["Root"]
      config: {"$MaxString": 1000, "$TypeName": "^[a-zA-Z][-._A-Za-z0-9]{0,63}$", "$FieldName": "^[$a-z][-_$A-Za-z0-9]{0,63}$"}
jadn_version: "http://oasis-open.org/openc2/jadn/v2.0/schema/"

Root = Record                                    // Canvas & Coordinates are two components encapsulated in one object. The canvas component is meant to be used in the playbook metadata level (section 3.1 in the CACAO specification [CACAO-Security-Playbooks-v2.0]), whereas the Coordinates component is meant to be used with Workflow Steps and Agent and Targets.
   1 type             String optional            // The value of this property MUST be layout.
   2 canvas           String optional            // This property defines the canvas size. 

This property MUST be used only in the “playbook_extension” property at the CACAO playbook metadata level as defined in section 3.1 of the CACAO specification.
   3 coordinates      String optional            // The coordinates of the visualized object in relation to the upper-left corner of the canvas. 

This property SHOULD be used in the “step_extensions” and/or “agent_target_extensions” CACAO properties.
